# Move selected pixels (translate + bilinear scale), resize, rotate.
doc 4000 3000
noise 9 random
sel-ellipse 500 500 2500 1800
tool Move
drag L 1700 1400 1900 1500 10
handle-radius 10
set resampling Bilinear
drag L 2700 2300 3200 2700 6
resize 2000 1500 SuperSampling
resize 4000 3000 Bilinear
rotate90cw
rotate-zoom 30 1.2 0 0 0
